title Cassette keys on the recordings list: Down, Enter plays, N renames, T opens the trim page, Delete asks in the confirm box (Tab and Enter answer), S the settings, Esc the recorder
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 300
key down
wait 200
@480x320 expect text "Take 005 selected. Esc returns to the recorder."
key n
wait 400
expect text "Name"
key esc
wait 300
expect text "RENAME"
say N opened the text box for the name; Esc closed it
key t
wait 400
expect text "POSITION"
key esc
wait 300
expect text "RENAME"
say T opened the trim page; Esc came back
key delete
wait 300
expect text "Delete Take 005?"
shot keys-delete
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Delete Take 005?"
expect text "Take 005"
say Enter answered CANCEL (the default): the take stays
key delete
wait 300
key tab
wait 200
shot keys-delete-focus
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Delete Take 005?"
expect notext "Take 005"
say Tab moved to DELETE, Enter deleted it
key enter
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 006 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
say Enter previewed the selected take (Take 004), Esc stopped the preview: the loaded Take 006 is in the deck, nothing plays
key l
wait 300
key l
wait 1300
expect text "SOFT"
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 004 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
expect text "Take 004"
say L loaded the selected take (Take 004) into the deck and showed the recorder
key l
wait 300
key s
wait 300
expect text "Codec"
expect noquit
